This directory contains the part of BLT 2.4j which TkDesk currently
requires (as of version 1.2). This may vanish over time when I find
other methods for performing these tasks:

	blt_bgexec: replace with Tk's fileevent?
	blt_busy: pure tcl replacement?
	blt_drag&drop: pure tcl replacement?
	
Note that you can also use an installed version of BLT 2.4j.
If you'd like to do this, run TkDesk's configure script with
the --with-blt=<path> flag.

The subdirectory diffs contains the diffs I had to make against
BLT 2.4j for TkDesk.


